For Zsh: vim ~/.zshrc.

Add 

```bash 
export OM_API_KEY="your_api_key"
```

Update the docker-compose file. Replace "unitree_go2_autonomy_advance" with the agent you want to run.
```bash
command: ["unitree_go2_autonomy_advance"]
```

```bash
cd OM1
docker-compose up om1 -d --no-build
```
